cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use H-CARE OCMS in your research, please cite this software."
type: software
title: "H-CARE OCMS: Healthcare Compliance-Aware Reliability Evaluation Research Prototype"
authors:
  - family-names: "Ramamoorthy"
    given-names: "Selvamurugan"
version: "1.0.1"
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23302442
date-released: "2026-10-11"
repository-code: "https://github.com/selva-git1982/hcare"
url: "https://github.com/selva-git1982/hcare/releases/tag/v1.0.1"
abstract: >-
  H-CARE OCMS is a research prototype for five-dimensional evaluation of
  healthcare and life-sciences data platforms. It includes weighted scoring,
  evidence-confidence adjustments, mandatory critical-control gates,
  synthetic evidence import, assessment history, and PDF reporting.
keywords:
  - healthcare data platforms
  - compliance-aware reliability
  - research software
  - synthetic assessment
